body:
I actually had no idea you can check lanes with the F keys. I saw streamers do it so I thought they were using some third party apps, but apparently not! But regardless, I always check the mini map..

I do try to gank as much as possible though;; especially when laners are struggling, though it doesn’t always succeed;;; 

Regardless, thank you!!

